  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: PartDescriptions_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1c18442350745f4e814e29abb60df84, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 325170562736128
    m_Localized: N/A
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3726913970176
    m_Localized: The end columns provide support for the end roof beams, as well
      as uphold the wall panels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3760002834432
    m_Localized: The end columns provide support for the end roof beams, as well
      as uphold the wall panels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3762473279488
    m_Localized: The middle coluimns provide structural support in the middle of
      the walls, being set between two sets of wall panels and supporting the middle
      roof beams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3817519325184
    m_Localized: The roof beams provide the support upon which the fiberglass roof
      will be set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3950822694912
    m_Localized: The side angle module is the connecting piece betwen the roof beam
      and columns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3982271586304
    m_Localized: The top angle module is the connecting piece between two roof beams
      and creates the peak of the roof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4051897032704
    m_Localized: The MPP is utilized to create the floor of the structure's platform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4159665479680
    m_Localized: The 4x4's are used as the side support beams for the floor panels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4183505903616
    m_Localized: The fiberglass roof rests on top of the roof beams, to which it
      is attached via screws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4209795801088
    m_Localized: 'The metal brackets are utilized to keep the columns upright and
      attached to the platform. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3896963637248
    m_Localized: The wall panels are used to create the wall of the structure, minimizinbg
      exposure to wind and weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3845386280960
    m_Localized: The roof purlins provide more support for the fiberglass roof to
      rest on. They slide into the gaps in the upper end of the roof beams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3903175401472
    m_Localized: The T-Pins are slid into the holes in the wall panels, they are
      utilized to hold the wall panels in place and keep them attached to the columns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4026588602368
    m_Localized: The dowels are used to secure the side angle module to the coumns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4092967657472
    m_Localized: The 4x6 is used as the center support beam for the floor panels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
